# Sevinne's Reclamation: "target permanent card with mana value 3 or less". Entomb puts Chandra, Torch of Defiance (mana
# value 4) into the graveyard: with only her there, Reclamation has no legal target and is not offered although the mana is
# there (a refusal). A second Entomb adds Palantír of Orthanc (mana value 3); on turn 3 the Reclamation returns the
# Palantír and leaves Chandra in the graveyard. Cast from the hand, it offers no copy.

